note Linux x86_64 open flags (asm-generic/fcntl.h): O_DIRECTORY 0200000 = 65536, O_NOFOLLOW 0400000 =
note 131072, O_CLOEXEC 02000000 = 524288, O_WRONLY 1, O_CREAT 64, O_EXCL 128, O_TRUNC 512. The stat
note words write Omega's 128-byte asm-generic (ARM64) structure on every target (OMEGESE section 10;
note omc.om: "Native x86 struct stat is private"), so mode is at 16 and size at 48 here as on AArch64;
note measured 2026-11-11 with omc 3ad9f10f and c52e986e under qemu-x86_64 (tools/bring/PLATFORMS.md).
fn pl_oflag how ulong to int
if eq how 1
ret 720896
end
if eq how 2
ret 655937
end
if eq how 3
ret 655553
end
if eq how 4
ret 524288
end
ret 655360
end
fn pl_mode b view uchar * to ulong
ret rd32 b 16
end
fn pl_size b view uchar * to ulong
ret rd64 b 48
end
